item thought:1 thought final at=3945 text="The user wants me to use a built-in tool for asking a question. I don't see a question tool in my available functions. Let me check what tools I have: bash, edit, glob, grep, read, skill, task, todowrite, webfetch, websearch, write. No question tool.\n\nThe system prompt mentions \"claude\" tools but the actual tool list doesn't include an ask-user/question tool. I should be honest that I don't have such a tool available. Let me check if there's any tool... The available skills mention mcp tools but they're not in my function list.\n\nI should tell the user I don't have a dedicated question-asking tool, and ask in chat. But the instruction says \"not plain chat\". I cannot fabricate a tool. Let me verify by checking if maybe there's something. The functions list is definitive—no question tool. I'll explain concisely."
